config DRM_VITA_IFTU
	tristate "DRM support for the PS Vita / PS TV IFTU display controller"
	depends on DRM && (ARCH_VITA || COMPILE_TEST)
	select APERTURE_HELPERS
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
	help
	  DRM driver for the IFTU display controller found on the PS Vita and
	  PS TV (Dolce). Takes over the framebuffer already configured and
	  scanned out by the bare-metal Linux loader (vita-baremetal-linux-loader)
	  -- fixed inherited mode only in the first milestone, no hardware
	  modeset, no vblank IRQ yet. See
	  lab/gpu-re/DISPLAY-DRM-RESEARCH-2026-08-30.md in the vita-linux-research
	  tree for the full register map, milestone ladder, and hardware
	  citations this driver is built from.

	  If M is selected the module will be called vita_iftu.
